       fetched live on 2026-10-05 (about 19:00-19:15 UTC) through scripts/nse.py. Only rows were
       dropped; kept rows are as NSE served them (JSON re-serialised with indentation).
       File (replay name)                              Source URL (www.nseindia.com/api/...)
       integrated-filing-results_<SYM>.json            integrated-filing-results?index=equities&symbol=<SYM>&type=Integrated Filing- Financials
